WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:08.070
I'd like each of you to get up and tell us a five minutes story about your summer

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:23.430
At some point you make a choice about who you are what you want

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:30.240
Hey, I'm Roo. I'm an addict.

00:00:32.029 --> 00:00:34.029
You're about to start a brand new chapter

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:40.300
Some new girl in town and I think you're gonna be friends with. I'm roo. I'm Jules.

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:49.329
Suddenly the whole world goes dark and nothing else matters, but the person standing in front of you

00:00:52.780 --> 00:01:00.000
I'm envious of your generation. You guys don't care as much about the rules. They're just reaching for something

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:03.360
To make it all seem meaningful

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:10.200
 

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:18.500
Every time I feel good, I think it'll last forever, but it doesn't

00:01:25.600 --> 00:01:27.600
Nothing lasts forever

00:01:30.729 --> 00:01:32.729
I've got an Idea. Should I be concerned?

00:01:34.930 --> 00:01:36.989
You think if I went to rehab I'd stay clean?

00:01:38.619 --> 00:01:40.619
I mean ain't that the point?

00:01:44.229 --> 00:01:49.038
If could be a different person, I would.

00:01:52.950 --> 00:01:56.660
Babycakes take your time, you're delicate.

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:01.210
I owe it to everyone I Love to at least try and change.

